    "font size" : 9.5,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "7.2.2 Transposition into national legislation"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 10,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 50.662, 78.761, 288.197, 131.251 ],
    "font" : "LMRoman9-Regular",
    "font size" : 9.5,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The European regulatory landscape is not homogeneous. All EU MSs must transpose EU Directives into their legislation as a minimum level of harmonization. As such, EU MSs have transposed the ePrivacy Directive in dif-"
  }, {
