      "font" : "LMRoman9-Regular",
      "font size" : 9.5,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "(i) The strictest category prescribes the opt-in mechanism – i.e., the user must provide consent. The consent must be obtained before cookies are used. This interpretation is in force in 11 EU MSs.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 296.495, 114.383, 533.167, 179.873 ],
      "font" : "LMRoman9-Regular",
      "font size" : 9.5,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "(ii) More ﬂexible interpretations allow the consent to be implied – i.e., inferred from the behavior of the user. In other words, consent can be conveyed by clicking a link or scrolling through a website. In 9 MSs, regulations allow implied consent.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
