      "bounding box" : [ 296.495, 75.383, 532.916, 114.873 ],
      "font" : "LMRoman9-Regular",
      "font size" : 9.5,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "(iii) Tolerant interpretations of the ePrivacy Directive do not require consent. The website must show a Cookie Bar warning users about the use of cookies, that can",
